Call of Duty World War two is a  thrilling return to the series  historical roots and in many ways so too  is its multiplayer traveling back over  70 years to the most infamous conflicts  in history has meant that innovations  seen in recent futuristic installments  have taken a backseat to restrict Lee  boots-on-the-ground  experience but bringing the action back  down to earth is no backwards step world  war 2 offers a lean muscular multiplayer  experience brought to you by Call of  Duty World War 2 when you first set foot  in the multiplayer trenches you'll be  greeted by something new this is your  introduction to the new division system  and your opportunity to choose an allied  division that best suits your playstyle  put simply divisions are a reinvention  of create a class removing the point  system and replacing it with five unique  paths each with their own upgradable  training and skill sets however don't  feel that this is a high-pressure  situation your choice is not permanent  and before long you'll have the  opportunity to use unlock tokens to try  out all the divisions that said let's  take a look at your options from the  outset  [Music]  for all rounders and beginners there's  the Infantry Division this division  specializes in all range rifle centric  combat unique to the division is a  bayonet charge which gives you the edge  in close quarters engagements as an  infantryman you'll also get an extra  attachment for your primary weapon which  promises to make you incredibly  formidable provided your aim doesn't let  you down  as the SMG wielding Airborne Division  you'll get up close and personal with  your grease gun the focus here is on  speed stealth and ruthless efficiency  and it's the only division that grants  you a suppressor for your weapon if you  prefer to keep your distance and provide  fire support the armoured division could  be a good fit the LMG is better deployed  at a safe distance with their large  magazines allowing for effective  sustained fire the addition of a bipod  means that you can get unmatched  stability while prone which can make you  unstoppable if you find the right sight  lines the emphasis on destruction is  bolstered by the m1 bazooka as your  secondary weapon and lethal sticky  grenades  [Music]  Mountain is the sniper division and with  the sniper sharpshooter division skill  it's never been a better time to try  your hand at long-range marksmanship  this skill blocks out anything outside  of the scope while also steadying your  aim and revealing enemy names in the  right hands it's devastating  you can also protect your six with the  bouncing betty s mine and conceal  yourself from player-controlled  scorestreaks like the glide bomb  finally at the other end of the range  scale there's expeditionary for  close-quarters combat the default gun is  a guaranteed one hits kill at close  range and even if you don't finish them  off immediately the incendiary shotgun  shells division skill will contribute  additional chip damage if the enemy  comes around a corner and its greeted by  you it's already too late  whatever your choice of division you can  also apply one of a wide selection of  basic skills although some are clearly  better suited to some divisions than  others for example undercover is a great  match for mountain as it doesn't reveal  enemy death locations and your enemy  won't see your name nor will a reticle  change color if your targeted it's a  sniper's dream divisions level up  independently to your overall player  level so it pays to dedicate yourself to  perhaps just one or a couple at a time  to get those additional division skills  rolling in quicker  in addition weapon levels are back and  will net you a wealth of useful  attachments so find what works best for  you match it to the corresponding  division and watch those deadly extras  come rolling in not to mention those  all-important unlock tokens before we  leave you keep an eye out for the button  prompts in the multiplayer menus the  names of your chosen divisions and even  the Allied nation you're representing  are not set in stone simply press  triangle on the appropriate menu screens  as is being demonstrated here and you  can personalize and customize to your  heart's content Call of Duty World War  two superb multiplayer streamlines some  familiar aspects for greater  accessibility yet with the addition of  divisions provides increased scope for  tactical customization and strategic  play in the next video we'll look at how  this works in practice as we jump boots  first into the all-new War mo  you
 

